            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaabo bakonkezya kumulandu wa-Samariya, baamba kuti, Mbwali muumi Leza wako, O Dani, nanka, Mbiili ngumi inzila yaBeereseba, bayoowida ansi akutabuka limbi.",
